#: 29491880f056471b87aa9e616da1265e
msgid "Recipe 4: Group `ScalarField` objects with `FieldList` / `FieldDict`"
msgstr "差分レシピ 4: `ScalarField` を `FieldList` / `FieldDict` でまとめる"

#: ../../explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:153
#: c00263bfba524a76aa93a0271cce415b
msgid ""
"Typical GWpy migration paths focus on series-like objects, and GWpy does not"
" provide a standard container layer for field-like data with shared spatial "
"metadata. In GWexpy, you can keep a single field in `ScalarField` and manage"
" multiple related fields through `FieldList` / `FieldDict`."
msgstr ""
"GWpy の標準的な移行対象は `TimeSeries` 系が中心で、空間軸を持つ field "
"コンテナや、そのコレクションに対応する標準クラスはありません。 GWexpy では、単一 field を `ScalarField` で保持し、複数の "
"field を `FieldList` / `FieldDict` で一括管理できます。"

#: ../../explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:188
#: c7b48512a20f458fb348df55389ae2c7
msgid ""
"you want multiple fields to share unit/axis/domain checks instead of "
"managing metadata by hand"
msgstr "同じ軸・単位・ドメインを共有する複数の field をまとめて扱いたいとき"

#: ../../explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:189
#: 19b2ff3bb61148ed9297753d3af66a0e
msgid ""
"you want spatial transforms or selections to stay at the collection level "
"rather than writing field-by-field loops"
msgstr "空間方向の変換や切り出しを、field 単位のループではなくコレクション単位で揃えたいとき"

